---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = "Voice AI Agents: How Australian Trades Are Automating Inbound Calls | PresciaIQ Insights";
const description = "Missed calls mean missed jobs. Voice AI agents can answer the phone, qualify the lead, and book the job directly into ServiceM8 or Simpro.";
const canonicalURL = new URL("/insights/voice-ai-agents-for-trades/", Astro.site).href;
const date = "2026-08-05";
const category = "AI Automations";

const schema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BlogPosting",
  "headline": title,
  "description": description,
  "image": "https://www.presciaiq.com.au/og-image.jpg",
  "author": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "PresciaIQ",
    "url": "https://www.presciaiq.com.au"
  },
  "publisher": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "PresciaIQ",
    "logo": {
      "@type": "ImageObject",
      "url": "https://www.presciaiq.com.au/logo.png"
    }
  },
  "datePublished": date,
  "dateModified": date,
  "mainEntityOfPage": {
    "@type": "WebPage",
    "@id": canonicalURL
  }
};
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} canonicalURL={canonicalURL}>
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(schema)} />

  <main class="min-h-screen bg-background text-foreground py-24">
    <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mb-12">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono font-semibold text-primary border border-primary/20 bg-primary/5">{category}</span>
          <time class="text-sm text-muted-foreground font-sans">{new Date(date).toLocaleDateString('en-AU', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' })}</time>
        </div>
        <h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-foreground mb-6 leading-tight">{title}</h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-muted-foreground font-sans leading-relaxed">{description}</p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-invert prose-lg max-w-none font-sans">
        <p>For trades and field service businesses, the phone is the lifeline of the business. But when you are under a house or on a roof, answering the phone is impossible. Every missed call to voicemail is a potential job lost to a competitor who answered their phone.</p><p>Voice AI has advanced to the point where it is indistinguishable from a human receptionist. PresciaIQ builds custom voice agents that answer your inbound calls immediately. These agents can qualify the caller, ask for the job details, provide an estimated call-out fee, and book the appointment directly into your scheduling software (like ServiceM8, AroFlo, or Simpro).</p><p>This is not a 'press 1 for sales' IVR system. It is a natural, conversational AI that handles the administrative burden of call management, allowing trades business owners to focus on the tools while the AI secures the pipeline.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-white/10">
        <div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center">
          <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-4">Ready to automate your operations?</h3>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-6">Book a scoping call with our team to discuss how custom AI automations can eliminate manual work in your business.</p>
          <a href="/start" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-primary text-primary-foreground font-semibold text-sm hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,255,136,0.3)] transition-all duration-300">
            Book a Scoping Call →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
